#: NAVIGATION.md:1
msgid "PLUMED Installation: An interactive guide"
msgstr "PLUMED インストール：対話型ガイド"

#: NAVIGATION.md:3
msgid ""
"There are a variety of different ways of getting your hands on PLUMED. For "
"example you can:"
msgstr "PLUMED の入手法はいくつもあります。例えば、"

#: NAVIGATION.md:5
msgid ""
"Install it from [Conda](conda.md). See "
"[here](https://docs.conda.io/en/latest/miniconda.html) for more info on "
"Conda."
msgstr ""
"[Conda](conda.md) から入れる。[Conda "
"の説明](https://docs.conda.io/en/latest/miniconda.html) も参照してください。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:6
msgid ""
"Install it from [MacPorts](macports.md). See "
"[here](https://www.macports.org) for more information on macports."
msgstr ""
"[MacPorts](macports.md) から入れる。[詳細](https://www.macports.org) も参照してください。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:7
msgid "Compile it yourself"
msgstr "自分でコンパイルする。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:9
msgid ""
"If you just want to run the code on your local machine to do the exercises "
"for the tutorials here we would recommend installing PLUMED from Conda. "
"However, if you want to use PLUMED to do production calculations we would "
"recommend compiling it yourself."
msgstr "ローカルで Tutorial を行うだけなら Conda、本計算には自分でコンパイルすることを推奨します。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:13
msgid ""
"If you are impatient the short version of the installation process is to use"
" the following three commands:"
msgstr "手短には次の3コマンドです。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:21
msgid ""
"Notice that you can set the location to install plumed using the `--prefix` "
"option when you call configure and that further details on these three "
"commands is available on [this page](installation_old.md). Alternatively, "
"[this page](Installation.md) presents the same information in a way that "
"some people find easier to navigate."
msgstr ""
"configure の `--prefix` でインストール先を指定できます。詳細は "
"[こちら](installation_old.md)、別の見やすい構成は [こちら](Installation.md) です。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:25
msgid ""
"You will most likely want to use PLUMED in tandem with an MD code. For some "
"MD codes we regularly test the interfaces between them and PLUMED. We "
"display the results obtained from these tests and the installation scripts "
"that we use for thse tests [here](http://plumed-testcenter.github.io). If "
"you are using an MD code that doesn't appear on that website you can find "
"the information we have on using it in tandem with PLUMED from the following"
" chart."
msgstr ""
"通常は MD コードと連携します。一部は定期テストし、結果とインストール Script を [公開](http://plumed-"
"testcenter.github.io) しています。載っていないコードの情報は次の Chart にあります。"

